167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We also had special on-camp days. We participated in our third annual LindenCup \(Olympics-themed, and, Yellow South America won!\) and celebrated our fourth annual Linden5K where we raised funds and awareness for SCOPE, a terrific organization which sends underserved children to camps across the country. Our Theme Days saw us dressed in our favorite jerseys, college apparel, tie dye and pajamas. We pretended we were twins and on a tropical beach. We also got creative with our bunkmates and dressed as an original Bunk Squad. We had BBQs and Ice Cream Socials on the back patio and grass.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (And, of course, right before the Summer of 2024 came to a close, after a few amazing Fake Outs, Color War broke with a surprise trip to the Iron Pigs Baseball Stadium - how cool was it to run and play in the outfield of a real baseball stadium?! Three days of spirit, sportsmanship and competition took place between White Casino Royale and Blue Carnival Celebration. It was a close battle, culminating with an unbelievable Sing. Ultimately, White won Color War 2024!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
