/ActualText (I am so grateful for our camp community and my family that surrounds me. I am thankful for the chance to see each summer unfold at Camp Lindenmere. Watching our campers, counselors, and leadership team laugh, learn, and grow makes me proud to be part of a place that feels like home to so many. I will always cherish the lifelong memories that we make together each summer!)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [16]
>>
