/ActualText (Prepare for an exhilarating adventure like never before as we unveil a series of exciting, new elements to our already legendary Ropes Course! Campers will be able to carve new routes when conquering the rock wall, zipline and the elements that spread through the trees. Don't miss out on the opportunity to be among the first to discover these breathtaking new routes and redefine your limits!)
