/ActualText (After the Midnight Artist left their mark leaving little clues around camp, the jigsaw puzzles were finally found and camp erupted as we learned that we would be loading the buses at dinner and heading to an unknown destination! With campers searching for clues on the journey, it was revealed that we would be adventuring to Coca-Cola Park in Allentown, the home of the Iron Pigs, for a very special and unique breakout! )
